  "notes": "Keyboard: arrows move, Space confirm (다음), C back, Esc pause. W/A/D in the play step do not drive the car (it stays at the start line at speed 000 while the race runs; the accelerate key is still unknown), so the pause menu is the proof of gameplay. The desktop window is black with UEVR; the menus show on the Mopic display in UEVR's UI quad. Recorded with UEVR's default UI settings (UI_Distance 2.0, UI_Size 2.0, Native Stereo Fix on): the quad fills most of the display (about x 64-1216, y 36-684 of the 1280x720 shot) and the 3D hub/race scene shows through the transparent parts of the menus, so the checkpoints sit on opaque UI (the 플레이 header, tile labels, dialog text, the pause menu's gadget panel). play_selected is the yellow checker glow in the 플레이 tile's lower left corner (the cursor arrows next to it slide and the LED pole behind them is animated). Class select is followed by a short 라이벌! (rival) screen before cup select. The pause menu opens with the cursor on 그랑프리 선택. store_dialog / store_close_selected are still from the old small UI quad (not seen at the default UI). Demo: only Grand Prix cup 1 and some characters are unlocked (a locked one opens a Steam store dialog: pick 닫기, never the store; character select starts on the locked Whisper, the recipe moves up to Sonic). Time Trial doesn't start. Route: intro > title > Play > Grand Prix > Sonic > car > class > cup > 출발 > race > pause > 메인 메뉴 > 네 > C (title) > C > 게임 종료.",
